Subject: [PATCH] Service the templating NuGet client family to 6.12.5

NuGet.Protocol and NuGet.Packaging 6.12.4 are affected by the package identity
validation issue GHSA-g4vj-cjjj-v7hg. Select the publisher's fixed 6.12.5
servicing release for the coordinated NuGet family already pinned together in
templating. Keep the original major/minor API line and NuGet audit enabled.
This patch does not change the separately built SDK NuGet implementation.

Advisory: https://github.com/NuGet/NuGet.Client/security/advisories/GHSA-g4vj-cjjj-v7hg
Base-VMR: 9f04b57d1366e21b3178648493d6edffeff2216e
Source-Reference: https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet/blob/v9.0.123/src/templating/eng/Versions.props

diff --git a/src/templating/eng/Versions.props b/src/templating/eng/Versions.props
--- a/src/templating/eng/Versions.props
+++ b/src/templating/eng/Versions.props
@@ -26,12 +26,12 @@
     <MicrosoftExtensionsLoggingAbstractionsVersion>9.0.3</MicrosoftExtensionsLoggingAbstractionsVersion>
     <MicrosoftExtensionsLoggingConsoleVersion>9.0.3</MicrosoftExtensionsLoggingConsoleVersion>
     <MicrosoftExtensionsDependencyInjectionAbstractionsVersion>9.0.3</MicrosoftExtensionsDependencyInjectionAbstractionsVersion>
-    <NuGetCommonVersion>6.12.4</NuGetCommonVersion>
-    <NuGetConfigurationVersion>6.12.4</NuGetConfigurationVersion>
-    <NuGetCredentialsVersion>6.12.4</NuGetCredentialsVersion>
-    <NuGetFrameworksVersion>6.12.4</NuGetFrameworksVersion>
-    <NuGetPackagingVersion>6.12.4</NuGetPackagingVersion>
-    <NuGetProtocolVersion>6.12.4</NuGetProtocolVersion>
-    <NuGetVersioningVersion>6.12.4</NuGetVersioningVersion>
+    <NuGetCommonVersion>6.12.5</NuGetCommonVersion>
+    <NuGetConfigurationVersion>6.12.5</NuGetConfigurationVersion>
+    <NuGetCredentialsVersion>6.12.5</NuGetCredentialsVersion>
+    <NuGetFrameworksVersion>6.12.5</NuGetFrameworksVersion>
+    <NuGetPackagingVersion>6.12.5</NuGetPackagingVersion>
+    <NuGetProtocolVersion>6.12.5</NuGetProtocolVersion>
+    <NuGetVersioningVersion>6.12.5</NuGetVersioningVersion>
   </PropertyGroup>
 </Project>
